[I] A lightweight compositor for X11

[T] picom is a standalone compositor for Xorg, suitable for use with
[T] window managers that do not provide compositing, such as dwm.
[T] It is a fork of compton, which in turn is a fork of xcompmgr-dana.

[U] https://github.com/yshui/picom

